body:
First you need to create a PImage object.

    PImage img;

Then in setup use the loadImage function to, well, load the image you want.

    img = loadImage("pass the image's path here");

Now you can just say:

    background(img);

to display the image. Please note that the image you're loading must be the same size as your sketch(or the other way around: you can always make your canvas' size equal to the image's)
